   "widgets_values": [
    "summary:\n[reference generation + audio reference] Two men talk in a bright, modern podcast studio. @Jon sits on the left and @Academia sits on the right.\n\ndetailed_description:\nInside a bright podcast studio with warm practical lights, @Jon sits on the left of frame and @Academia sits on the right, both facing each other across a small table with microphones. Medium two-shot, static camera. @Jon (@Jon.S), in the voice referenced from @Jon.voice, says: <d>[Spanish] ¿Has visto lo que hacen los RefMods nuevos?</d>. @Academia (@Academia.S), in the voice referenced from @Academia.voice, smiles and answers: <d>[Spanish] Sí, por fin cada uno conserva su cara y su voz.</d>\n\noverall_soundscape:\nnon_diegetic_music: N/A",
